{"title":"New \u0026 Trending","description":"\u003ch3\u003eNew \u0026amp; Trending Artificial Christmas Trees and Decor \u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery holiday season brings a fresh wave of Christmas tree inspiration, from viral styles taking over social media feeds to timeless aesthetics reimagined for modern homes. At Carol's Christmas Conifers, our New and Trending Christmas collection is where holiday design meets the moment. Here you will find our newest artificial Christmas trees, and seasonal decor, curated to reflect the looks, styles and lighting trends that are capturing attention and inspiring home decorators this year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are looking for trending Christmas inspiration or searching for something new, this is the collection to start with.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat is a trending Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA trending Christmas tree is one that has captured widespread attention, whether through social media, home design publications, or viral moments online, for its distinctive look, lighting or curated inspired design. Trending trees and decor tend to reflect a shift in the way people plan their holiday aesthetic, moving beyond traditional styling and classic color palettes to something that feels unique and inspires decorators to reimagine what a Christmas tree can look like. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat is the viral Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe viral Christmas tree trend that has taken over social media features clustered micro LED lights that create a layered twinkling glow unlike traditional pre-lit trees. These trees use densely grouped and layered micro LED clusters that nestle within the foliage. The result is a sparkling, layered glow that photographs beautifully and looks even more stunning in person. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/silverpeak-fir-trees\" title=\"Silverpeak Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eSilverpeak Fir\u003c\/a\u003e from Carol's Christmas Conifers delivers exactly this effect, with premium mixed PE and PVC foliage, clustered micro LED twinkle lights in warm white and multicolor settings, and 10 adjustable lighting modes. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow does Carol's Christmas Conifers keep up with Christmas tree trends?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur New and Trending collection is updated to reflect the styles, designs and decorating ideas that are capturing attention each holiday season. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWe curate it around the looks and styles that are genuinely capturing attention, whether the trending decor is nostalgic and traditional, boldly colorful, or modern and minimal. This collection helps you find this season's most talked about holiday aesthetic. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWhether you are looking for the tree you saw go viral, a style that reflects the season's most talked-about holiday aesthetic, or simply something new that feels different from what you have had before, the Carol's Christmas Conifers New \u0026amp; Trending collection is where to start. Explore our newest arrivals and find a tree that brings this season's freshest holiday inspiration into your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"7-5-pink-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Duchess Pink Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Pink","offer_id":30106209943616,"sku":"PINKF-T7-5L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Pink.Duchess_a8384dbd-fa30-4a3e-bf11-a02b344a79b9.jpg?v=1718158678"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ LED","offer_id":40284906127560,"sku":"SF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Scarlet-Fir-v2_258fd985-d3b0-45c7-a94b-c67d936baf09.jpg?v=1722013587"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-flock-tree-led","title":"7' King Noble Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41317601476808,"sku":"KNFL-T7-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleFlockLED.jpg?v=1723214176"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Rushmore Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":41324037636296,"sku":"RUSF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFir.png?v=1722013356"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Rushmore Flock Artificial Christmas Tree 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41404937994440,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T7.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlockLED.jpg?v=1723214362"},{"product_id":"rosegold-frozen-branch-picks","title":"Rosegold Frozen Branch Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMix in a touch of icy wintry beauty with a set of our Rose Gold Frozen Branch Picks. With a metallic\n\u003cbr\u003eambiance highlighted by elegant splashes of rose gold, these picks inject that traditional glittery semblance into to your holiday décor, creating a shimmering atmosphere that sparks the best memories. 12 picks are\n\u003cbr\u003eincluded for endless possibilities!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42332373024968,"sku":"PK12-ROSEG","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2022TreePickFlatLayFinal-21.jpg?v=1718159334"},{"product_id":"sugar-berry-picks","title":"Sugar Berry Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdding a splash of color to your holiday oasis is easy with a set of our faux Sugar Berry Picks. Studded with\n\u003cbr\u003ered berries and featuring slight variations from branch to branch, these picks are the perfect accent for your\n\u003cbr\u003emantel, tabletop display, or anywhere else you need a touch of genuine seasonal ambiance. 12 picks are\n\u003cbr\u003eincluded for endless possibilities!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42332383117512,"sku":"PK12-SUGB","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/RedWhiteBerryTree-2.jpg?v=1722012823"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-pencil-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Pencil Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42854044139720,"sku":"PFP-T7-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrincePencilTreeLED.jpg?v=1786129938"},{"product_id":"9-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-slim-tree-led","title":"9' Tribeca Blue Spruce Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":42902224666824,"sku":"TBS-SL-T9-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSlimLED_8cb54fa4-48ab-4757-9baf-84cc74f539ba.jpg?v=1722014311"},{"product_id":"15-pack-red-green-glass-ornament","title":"Mistletoe 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Red-Green)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Limited Edition Mistletoe Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering a classic blend of red, green and gold; this beautiful set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036334792,"sku":"DHC3M8C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Mistletoecopy_1.png?v=1714674592"},{"product_id":"15-pack-silver-gold-glass-ornament","title":"Mixed Metals 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Silver-Gold)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Limited Edition Mistletoe Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering an elegant metallic blend of silvers and golds; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036367560,"sku":"JEJ9W8W","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/MixedMetals15pieceglassornamentset.png?v=1714674598"},{"product_id":"12-pack-gold-accents","title":"Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of glamorous golds; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Silver Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036793544,"sku":"JMF2K4E","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Untitleddesign_17.png?v=1771956501"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 3400 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5'","offer_id":44792074764488,"sku":"SLP-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"4-5-windsor-tree-flock-led","title":"4.5' Windsor Flock Tree with 150 Warm White Twinkle LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serenity of freshly fallen snow indoors with our newest and most captivating addition yet, The Flocked Windsor Collection. This graceful accent tree adds a touch of wintry charm on its own or pairs beautifully with your centerpiece tree for a cohesive, magical display. A must-have for a cozy holiday atmosphere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"4.5' \/ Flock","offer_id":44828197257416,"sku":"WNFL-T4.5-L","price":159.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Windsor_Main_Image.jpg?v=1765377801"},{"product_id":"4-5-windsor-tree-fir-led","title":"4.5' Windsor Fir Tree with 150 Warm White Twinkle LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring natural holiday charm to every corner of your home with our newest and most enchanting addition, The Windsor Collection. Designed with realistic foliage and graceful form, it shines as a beautiful accent to your main tree or a statement piece all its own. Effortless, classic, and full of Christmas spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"4.5' \/ Green","offer_id":44828939518152,"sku":"WNFR-T4.5-L","price":159.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Windorfir.png?v=1786127497"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 1800 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128135737544,"sku":"QFS-T7.5-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockSlimArtificialChristmasTreewith1800LuxLEDLights.jpg?v=1782847365"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128138555592,"sku":"QF-T7.5-LUX","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockArtificialChristmasTreeLux.jpg?v=1782848477"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-lux-led","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 2000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128139866312,"sku":"KNF-T7-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7_KingNobleFirLuxLED.jpg?v=1782849139"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-douglas-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Douglas Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":45128140947656,"sku":"KDF-T7.5-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_KingDouglasFirArtificialChristmasTreeLED.png?v=1782849524"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-alpine-fir-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128150221000,"sku":"AFG-T7.5-LUX","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirwithLuxLEDLights.png?v=1782850052"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-soho-spruce-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Soho Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree 2000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of a real Siberian Spruce into your home with a tree designed to capture its naturally elegant shape. Featuring layered branches, fine spruce-inspired needles, and a realistic open profile, it creates exceptional depth and dimension while maintaining a full, balanced appearance. The thoughtfully spaced branches provide the perfect backdrop for ornaments to shine, delivering a timeless look that feels both natural and refined throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45128150909128,"sku":"SHSP-T7.5-LUX","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/NewSohoSpruce.png?v=1783960631"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Silverpeak_fir.png?v=1760474335","url":"/\/collections\/new-trending.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}